sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor SRE as Operator / On-Call
    participant EventBus as Event Engine / Trigger Evaluator
    participant Engine as Playbook Execution Engine
    participant Gate as Human Approval Gate
    participant Worker as Action Dispatcher
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Audit as Audit Logger

    EventBus->>Engine: Trigger Event (Alert / Incident / Manual Run)
    Engine->>DB: Query Active Playbooks Matching Trigger Criteria
    DB-->>Engine: Return Matching Playbook & Step Definitions
    Engine->>DB: Create PlaybookExecution (status: RUNNING)
    Engine->>Audit: Record Execution Start Event

    loop For Each Step in Playbook
        alt Step Type: Automated Action (HTTP / Webhook / Script)
            Engine->>Worker: Dispatch Step Action (Payload & Config)
            Worker->>Worker: Execute Action with Timeout & Retry
            Worker-->>Engine: Action Result (success/failure, output data)
            Engine->>DB: Update StepExecution (status: COMPLETED, log output)
        else Step Type: Human Approval Required
            Engine->>Gate: Create Approval Request (status: PENDING)
            Engine->>DB: Update Execution (status: WAITING_APPROVAL)
            Gate->>SRE: Send Approval Notification (In-App / Slack)
            SRE->>Gate: Review Context & Submit "Approve" Decision
            Gate-->>Engine: Resume Execution with Approver Identity
            Engine->>DB: Update StepExecution (status: APPROVED, approved_by)
            Engine->>Audit: Record Approval Audit Event
        else Step Type: AI Diagnostic Step
            Engine->>Worker: Invoke AI Investigation Step
            Worker-->>Engine: Diagnostic Summary & Recommended Next Steps
            Engine->>DB: Update StepExecution with AI Insight
        end
    end

    alt All Steps Successful
        Engine->>DB: Update PlaybookExecution (status: COMPLETED, finished_at)
        Engine->>Audit: Log Execution Success
        Engine-->>SRE: Notify Playbook Execution Complete
    else Step Failed & Retries Exhausted
        Engine->>DB: Update PlaybookExecution (status: FAILED, error_message)
        Engine->>Audit: Log Execution Failure
        Engine-->>SRE: Alert Execution Failure with Diagnostics
    end
